OL,3,GNEWSAAll city homes to get food waste
OL,4,Abins by end of year
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiverpool City Council has confirmed
OL,7,Fall homes across the city will have
OL,8,Freceived a food waste bin by the end of
OL,9,Fthe year.
OL,11,FMore than 100,000 households have
OL,12,Falready received the bins, with about
OL,13,F100 tonnes of food waste being
OL,14,Fcollected each week, the authority
OL,15,Fsaid.
OL,17,FThe next phase of the roll-out will
OL,18,Fstart from 26 October.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
