OL,3,GNEWSAAll city homes to get food waste
OL,4,Abins by end of year
OL,5,
OL,6,FEach household is provided with two
OL,7,Ffood waste bins or "caddies", a smaller
OL,8,Fcontainer for use inside the home and a
OL,9,Flarger one to be stored alongside
OL,10,Fexisting purple, blue and green bins.
